        "content": "## Free Browser Extensions & Ready CSV Packs\n\n- [Shopify Product CSV Exporter & Theme Spy (Chrome/Edge)](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/oemdcnkhnpjnpcbalcbfppeblfepnfdi)\n- [Skool MRR Calculator & Community CSV Exporter (Chrome/Edge)](https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/emcboifchcknlchghjbafmiolpkklemb)\n- [Free Live 246-Row Sample Datasets](https://mikrozar-cell.github.io/b2b-ecommerce-saas-scrapers-n8n-clay/samples.html)\n- [Full Commercial B2B CSV Bundle ($49)](https://mikrozaar.gumroad.com/l/kevhup)",
